  "solution": "**Given:-**\n\n25 - [20 - {10 - (7 - 2)}]\n\n**Concept used:-**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a78edd631f4c76dc559660378776e8701e138c7afaa29353980ed12f833bc1f2.png] \n\n**Calculation:-**\n\n⇒** **25 - [20 - {10 - (7 - 2)}]\n\n⇒ 25 - [20 - {10 - 5}]\n\n⇒ 25 - [20 - 5]\n\n⇒ 25 - 15\n\n⇒ **10**\n\n**∴ option 2 is right.**",
